ating":5,"contributor_id":"101188642742798250325","user_review_count":9,"user_photo_count":13,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUSvbEypxfQsspdzj2O2gB2aWPe0Vqwou9F81KLbIk1RaofkuXkng=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","description":"Had an amazing breakfast experience at Paz Goa! The ambience is beautiful, calm, and perfect for a relaxed morning. We tried the English Breakfast, Veg Grilled Cheese Sandwich, Veggie Omelette, Hummus Toast with Fried Egg & Chilli Oil, and everything was fresh, flavorful, and well presented.\n\nThe coffee was excellent too — the Espresso, Cappuccino, and Americano were all perfectly brewed. The Ball Blast drinks and Mango Daiquiri were refreshing and complemented the food well.\n\nWhat really stood out was the quality of ingredients, generous portions, and friendly service. The cozy beach-town vibe, comfortable seating, and peaceful atmosphere make it a great spot to unwind with friends or family.\n\nHighly recommend Paz Goa for breakfast, brunch, coffee, and good vibes. Will definitely visit again on my next trip to Goa!\n\n🌟 Great food, great coffee, great ambience, and excellent service. A must-visit cafe in Goa. 🌟","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSdk5Xc3lZVjlJZUV3M1VIRlNZMmhYVjFWYVEyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x803e1bc19386dcd0!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkRvNWsyYV9IeEw3UHFSY2hXV1VaQ2c%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmP-RdhTDOygGikKYOhbXD8k7KIUeYiDlpEV9MQXTYG8WyzhItAZODka58YCcMbZv7pe4mtLt0OykwGJKCxhRO8qAM640Hz-dqZ6FUTEX4ig1DWZZ-8LVuvTy7YmH9BY7nvQBT_YnMWNtLo=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNXa7_go5Qo69qnHq65SOBI3ZUFus6RWRW1VRTRYHnDrmDuurV9UrTf-wug7Z-tmaEL7xUKfvGDdj17iIiQMkrsgUV22vK91hpfELBrxrPjlJ00Ylkya8f6Lt7sCpt1FQiBS-bvdUVNeWAq=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNv-BiitlWnHcfAPRFtHvxF8RD38gOd-KRBbvmAEKxxO7hMMns2DvH58hiu_I9gKHE7P-IwP0bvnAm1kM